  "intended_meaning": "Ask the gate serjeant for patrol names and what favor could earn the information.",
  "generation_attempt_1": "\"The patrol route was changed,\" the gate serjeant explains, eyeing the notice board with a sharp glance. \"After the Ash Compact's census choke worsened, they redirected the patrol to avoid the eastern caravan bottleneck. As for the roster, those are held tight—only certain favors granted through official channels might see names loosened for public notice. If you want to pry that open, you’d need to speak with someone higher up in the guard captain's office.\"",
